WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Actual Play test build21 on an Android16 emulator.
This screen recording does not capture alarm audio.

00:04.000 --> 00:12.000
The new reminder uses Morning Bell and a near-future time.

00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
One-minute saved ring limit, repetition and user-controlled actions.
Save the reminder, return Home and put the screen to sleep.

00:19.000 --> 00:31.000
The real scheduled alarm opens the ringing screen.

00:31.000 --> 00:40.000
The ongoing alarm notification offers Dismiss and Snooze.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.480
Dismiss stops this active alarm before its saved limit.
